<title>USA: Leading Edge names Moran as president.</title>
<headline>Leading Edge names Moran as president.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Edge Earth Products Inc said on Monday it has appointed David Moran as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Leading Edge said in a statement Moran brings more than 20 years of senior management experience in the manufactured housing industry, including executive positions with  Champion Home Builders,  Redman Industries, Fleetwood Enterprises Inc and  Wick Building Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Moran replaces Grant Record as president. Record will remain as chief executive officer.</p>
